      "views": [
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<b>Weather No Freeze !</b> the successor to <b>Forecast</b>, <b>WeatherBoard</b>, <b>Asteroid</b>, and <b>WeatherGround</b> is finally here for iOS 16!<br><br>Stops the Weather wallpaper from freezing on your Lock Screen & Home Screen and even more !",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• <b>Unfreeze the Weather wallpaper</b> :<br>- Disables the freezing of the animations on the Weather wallpaper (Lock Screen & Home Screen).",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• <b>Animation speed</b> :<br>- Adjust the speed with a slider, up to 10 times faster ! (The iOS default is 1.00).",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• <b>Simulate the weather you want</b> :<br>- Force any weather condition (48 to choose from, or keep your local weather).<br>- Force the sky background to Auto, Day or Night.",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• <b>Lock Screen backlight</b> :<br>- Customize or disable the Auto-Lock delay of the Lock Screen (The delay resets when you touch or unlock the screen).",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• <b>10 languages</b> :<br>English, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese, Dutch, Russian, Simplified Chinese and Japanese.",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• Settings live in :<br><b>Settings</b> --› <b>Weather No Freeze</b> (A respring is not needed to apply all changes).",
          "useSpacing": true,
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
